==English==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:bor|la:bonus<t:good>|tree=1|text=+}} {{dbt|en|bona}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈbəʊ.nəs/|a=RP}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-bonus.wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈboʊ.nəs/|a=GA,CA}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Wodencafe-bonus.wav|a=Texas}}
